{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002274","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002274"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002274","label":"趙史援（趙世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"趙史援","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0055"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0055","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p015","quote":"趙史援"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-043","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0055"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:p015"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-043-zhao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"趙史援","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002274","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-045","person_id":"cbr-p002274","surfaces":["趙史援"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p015","quote":"晉景公之三年，大夫屠岸賈欲誅趙氏。初，趙盾在時，夢見叔帶持要而哭，甚悲；已而笑，拊手且歌。盾卜之，兆絶而後好。趙史援占之，曰：「此夢甚惡，非君之身，乃君之子，然亦君之咎。至孫，趙將世益衰。」屠岸賈者，始有寵於靈公，及至於景公而賈爲司寇，將作難，乃治靈公之賊以致趙盾，遍告諸將曰：「盾雖不知，猶爲賊首。以臣弒君，子孫在朝，何以懲罪？請誅之。」韓厥曰：「靈公遇賊，趙盾在外，吾先君以爲無罪，故不誅。今諸君將誅其後，是非先君之意而今妄誅。妄誅謂之亂。臣有大事而君不聞，是無君也。」屠岸賈不聽。韓厥告趙朔趣亡。朔不肯，曰：「子必不絶趙祀，朔死不恨。」韓厥許諾，稱疾不出。賈不請而擅與諸將攻趙氏於下宮，殺趙朔、趙同、趙括、趙嬰齊，皆滅其族。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名字、是為與連續事件暫接異稱；真孤與替代兒分開，馬匹、群體與闕代不當個人，不以模型記憶補熟知姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_d